{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月になったね...(♡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月は、誕生日の月だし、\nポカポカしてくるし、\nお花見の季節になってくるし...\n気分もウキウキで一年で一番好きな月かもっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりみんな\n自分が生まれた月が好きなのかな～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/03/3199710/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はひな祭りだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後陽菜祭り！！！！！\nたくさん川後の話題をばらまこうキャンペーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな友達や周りなど\nいろんなところで\n川後をひろめてください(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな祭りに便乗...."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/03/3199710/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陽菜の名前はひな祭りのひなをとって、\n漢字は暖かい陽だまりと菜の花の季節に生まれたって事で、陽菜だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/03/3199710/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/03/3199710/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに\nわたしの地元・長崎県では\nひな祭りの時に食べる、\n桃カステラがあるんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/03/3199710/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/03/3199710/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/03/3199710/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと長崎にいる時はいつもおばあちゃんが手作りの甘酒を作ってくれてました。甘酒って飲む点滴っていわれるほど栄養があるし、美容にも良いらしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/03/3199710/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/03/3199710/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/03/3199710/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残り少ないセブンティーンを楽しむよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/03/3199710/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/03/3199710/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも最後まで読んでくれてありがとう。ね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/03/3199710/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}